{
  "folder": "OAuxoB1IH92hjL3G",
  "name": "自动侏儒 Autognome (AAG)",
  "type": "race",
  "_id": "R8BjUYzxNPHbiR70",
  "img": "icons/creatures/magical/construct-golem-robot-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>属性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>体型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>选择一项：</p><p>(a)选择一项属性+2;选择一项不同的属性+1 (b)选择三项不同的属性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>小型</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30尺</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><h3>生物类型 Creature Type。</h3><p> 你是构装生物。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">体型 Size。</strong> 你的体型为小型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度为30尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">装甲外壳 Armored Casing。</strong> 你的身体有着由薄金属或其他的耐用材料制成的外壳。若你未穿着护甲，你的基础护甲等级变为 13+你的敏捷调整值。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">铸订成功 Built for Success。</strong> 进行攻击检定，属性检定，或豁免检定时，你可以在检定中加入一颗 d4。你能在看到d20骰值后。但该次检定的效应还没处理前再决定是否使用这一特质。你能使用此特质次数等同于 你的熟练加值 次，完成一次长休后，你重获所有已消耗的使用次数。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">可被再生构造 Healing Machine。</strong>如果一次法术 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">修复术Mending</em> 被施展到你身上，你可以花费并投掷一枚生命骰，你恢复 投掷结果+你的体质调整值 点生命值（至少1点生命值）。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">此外，你的创造者将你设计为能受益于一些保护生命但通常不影响构装生物的法术：<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">疗伤术Cure Wound</em>、<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">治愈真言Healing Word</em>、<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">群体疗伤术Mass Cure Wound</em>，<em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">群体治愈真言Mass Healing Word</em> 和 <em style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">维生术Spare the Dying</em>。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">机械本质 Mechanical Nature。</strong> 你具有毒素伤害抗性，并免疫于疾病。你为防止陷入麻痹或中毒所做的豁免具有优势。你不需要吃、喝、呼吸。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">哨兵式休息 Sentry’s Rest。</strong> 当你进行长休时，你需要花费6小时处于一种静止的、非激活的状态，以代替睡眠。这种状态下，你会表现的十分迟缓，但不会失去意识。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">专业设计 Specialized Design。</strong> 你获得两项自选的工具熟练，从《玩家手册》中进行选择。</p><p><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">语言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你的角色能够说、读和写通用语和另一种你和 DM 认为适合该角色的语言。《玩家手册》提供了一项可供选择的泛用语言列表。DM 能自由地为特定战役从列表中去掉或增加语言。</p></div><p>自动侏儒是由岩侏儒所打造的机器存在。有时因为故障或某类独特状况，自动侏儒会与它的创造者分离，并产生自我。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">自动侏儒与它的创造者有许多相似之处，且大多数自动侏儒会被编写成能够朗读或理解侏儒语的程序。自动侏儒的内部零件构成可以非常奔放；一个自动侏儒的胸腔里或许有着一个正在跳动的真正心脏，而另一个却或许是由星尘或错综复杂的发条齿轮组供能。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">投掷自动侏儒历史表，或是选择一项你喜欢的结果来决定你是如何踏上冒险之途的。如果表格里的内容都不满足你的喜好，和你的DM商讨一个适合的角色起源故事。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">如同侏儒们一样，自动侏儒们能活数个世纪，通常最多为500年。</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Autognome History\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption>自动侏儒历史</caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">[[/r d6]]</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-10\">故事</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">1</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">你的创造者给了你自主权，然后催促你去追寻你的梦想。</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">2</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">你的创造者已故，你不得不自谋出路了。</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">3</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">一个故障导致你忘了你原来的程序设定。你不记得是谁创造了你，也不记得自己是从哪里来的。</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">4</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">你不喜欢你的创造者对待你的方式，所以你从家里逃了出来。</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">5</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">你被创造出来完成一个特别的任务。</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">6</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">你觉得自己被设计目的所束缚，所以你抛下了你的创造者，决定去寻找更伟大的目标。</td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Creature Type.</span> You are a Construct.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Armored Casing\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Armored Casing.</span> You are encased in thin metal or some other durable material. While you aren't wearing armor, your base Armor Class is 13 + your Dexterity modifier.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Built for Success\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Built for Success.</span> You can add a [[/r d4]] to one attack roll, ability check, or saving throw you make, and you can do so after seeing the [[/r d20]] roll but before the effects of the roll are resolved. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Healing Machine\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Healing Machine.</span> If the @spell[mending] spell is cast on you, you can spend a Hit Die, roll it, and regain a number of hit points equal to the roll plus your Constitution modifier (minimum of 1 hit point).</p><p>In addition, your creator designed you to benefit from several spells that preserve life but that normally don't affect Constructs: @spell[cure wounds], @spell[healing word], @spell[mass cure wounds], @spell[mass healing word], and @spell[spare the dying].</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mechanical Nature\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Mechanical Nature.</span> You have resistance to poison damage and immunity to disease, and you have advantage on saving throws against being &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed] or &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]. You don't need to eat, drink, or breathe.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Sentry's Rest\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Sentry's Rest.</span> When you take a long rest, you spend at least 6 hours in an inactive, motionless state, instead of sleeping. In this state, you appear inert, but you remain conscious.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Specialized Design\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Specialized Design.</span> You gain two tool proficiencies of your choice, selected from the <span class=\"bold\">Player's Handbook</span>.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div><p>Autognomes are mechanical beings built by rock gnomes. Sometimes, because of a malfunction or a unique circumstance, an autognome becomes separated from its creator and strikes out on its own.</p><p>An autognome bears a resemblance to its creator, and most autognomes are programmed to speak and understand Gnomish. The internal components used in an autognome's manufacture can vary wildly; one autognome might have an actual beating heart in its chest cavity, while another might be powered by stardust or intricate clockwork gears.</p><p>Roll on the Autognome History table or choose an entry that you like to identify what event set you on the path to adventure. If nothing on the table appeals to you, work with your DM to create an origin story for your character.</p><p>Like gnomes, autognomes can live for centuries, typically up to 500 years.</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Autognome History\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption>Autognome History</caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">[[/r d6]]</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-10\">Story</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">1</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Your creator gave you autonomy and urged you to follow your dreams.</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">2</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">Your creator died, leaving you to fend for yourself.</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">3</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">A glitch caused you to forget your original programming. You don't remember who made you or where you came from.</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">4</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">You didn't like how you were being treated by your creator, so you ran away from home.</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">5</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">You were built to complete a special mission.</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-2 ve-text-center\">6</td><td class=\"ve-col-10\">You felt trapped in the role for which you were built and abandoned your creator, determined to find a greater purpose.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
